    "created_at": "2026-11-21T01:47:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-21T01:47:26Z",
    "body": "fix on issue/2881-offset-tangent-window · PR #3107 · pinned by a_steep_fillet_chord_keeps_the_ride_on_the_nose, a_sloped_inside_corner_is_not_gouged, the_inside_ride_obeys_the_same_window · merges when reviewed\n\nThe same fix also closes a small gouge. Before the fix, a sloped face did not claim the stations before its inside corner, so the ride stood nearer than the nose radius there. The pin `a_sloped_inside_corner_is_not_gouged` measures 0.884 instead of 1.0. The catalog program `turning/cone-thread` showed it at the cone-to-flat corner.\n",
